# Per-profile secrets for Hermes profile jarvis.
# Live values only on Docker volume /opt/data/profiles/jarvis/.env — never commit.
# Doctrine: docs/agents/runbooks/multi-agent-config-lanes.md
# Capabilities: docs/agents/runbooks/jarvis-capabilities.md
# Full setup: hermes/scripts/jarvis-setup.sh

# --- Model auth (one working path is enough) ---
# Preferred (Spectral/Wildwood style): xAI Grok SuperGrok OAuth — NOT an env key.
#   docker exec -it jarvis-hermes hermes -p jarvis auth add xai-oauth --type oauth
#   Stores refreshable tokens in profile auth.json (secrets lane; never commit).
# Optional API-key fallbacks:
# XAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- Adaptive state backup (private git; host nightly cron) ---
# Fine-grained GitHub PAT: contents:write to THIS repo ONLY. Do not reuse for OMG read.
# JARVIS_BACKUP_REPO=https://github.com/org/jarvis-state.git
# JARVIS_BACKUP_GITHUB_TOKEN=
# JARVIS_BACKUP_BRANCH=main
# JARVIS_BACKUP_WORKDIR=

# --- OMG repo read (runtime CoS familiarity) — SEPARATE from backup token ---
# Fine-grained PAT or GitHub App install token: contents:read on selected OMG repos only.
# JARVIS_GITHUB_READ_TOKEN=

# --- Linear read-only (issue correlation for research / digests) ---
# Personal API key with read access only when possible.
# JARVIS_LINEAR_API_KEY=

# --- Jira Cloud read-only ---
# API token (https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens) + account email + site.
# JARVIS_JIRA_BASE_URL=https://your-domain.atlassian.net
# JARVIS_JIRA_EMAIL=
# JARVIS_JIRA_API_TOKEN=

# --- Morning digest email (SMTP) ---
# JARVIS_SMTP_HOST=
# JARVIS_SMTP_PORT=587
# JARVIS_SMTP_USER=          # auth identity (primary mailbox for app password)
# JARVIS_SMTP_PASSWORD=
# JARVIS_SMTP_STARTTLS=1
# JARVIS_DIGEST_TO=
# JARVIS_DIGEST_FROM=        # visible From; may be alias ≠ SMTP_USER
# JARVIS_DIGEST_FROM_NAME=Jarvis
# Workspace/Gmail: alias only shows as From if authorized Send mail as for SMTP_USER.
# Optional deep-link in email footer (opens Slack app/client on home DM/channel):
# JARVIS_DIGEST_SLACK_URL=https://app.slack.com/client/T…/D…
# Or set SLACK_HOME_CHANNEL=D… (and optional SLACK_TEAM_ID=T…) — footer builds the link.

# --- Slack CoS chat (Socket Mode) ---
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=
# SLACK_APP_TOKEN=
# SLACK_ALLOWED_USERS=
# SLACK_ALLOWED_CHANNELS=
# SLACK_HOME_CHANNEL=
